#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""murmur — the babbling glass (Moonring-style NPC).

Sit with the glass. Speak. Mostly noise. Sometimes a clean word falls through.

    murmur                  conversation TUI (default)
    murmur "ash and egg"    one exchange, then exit
    murmur -h               unhelpful flavor

Never a walkthrough. Never the true name of the egg.
"""
